{"id":"barra","lemma":"barra","pos":"noun","rank":2089,"glosses":["bar, rod (a solid, more or less rigid object of metal or other material with a uniform cross-section smaller than its length)","bar (a counter, or simply a cabinet, from which alcoholic drinks are served in a private house or a hotel room.)","bar (various lines used as punctuation or diacritics, such as the pipe ⟨|⟩, fraction bar (as in ¹⁄₂))"],"ipa":"/ˈbara/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"barras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-barra.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesitamos una barra de hierro.","en":"We need an iron bar.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800796","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"strong"]]},{"text":"Me dejé caer por la barra.","en":"I slid down the pole.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512079","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"to fall"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Barra el suelo, por favor.","en":"Please sweep the floor.","words":[null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"dirt"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"please"]]},{"text":"Ella compró una barra de pan esta mañana.","en":"She bought a loaf of bread this morning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635314","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"bread"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Me deslicé barra abajo.","en":"I slid down the pole.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512078","words":[{"g":"me"},null,null,{"g":"down, downwards"}]}]}